content.text:
I've logged your Q3 answer and my challenges in [NOTES.md](NOTES.md) and [ideas.md](ideas.md), and added the transfer assumption to the limitations. Everything is pushed. Three things are open:
- your reason for choosing 1,000 over 250;
- the stage sizes;
- how to measure the error at each stage.

